<title>CANADA: Pallet Pallet ends talks with BankAmerica.</title>
<headline>Pallet Pallet ends talks with BankAmerica.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pallet Pallet said on Wednesday that it terminated negotiations with BankAmerica Corp unit Bank of America to secure a consolidated working capital line of credit.</p>
<p>Pallet Pallet said it was negotiating with three other regional financial institutions to consolidate existing lines of credit and would continue to fund its daily capital requirements through existing lines of credit until negotiations were completed.</p>
<p>((Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100))</p>
</text>
